## Chapter three: what the tooling gives you

%% fragments

- `reveal-carve lint` catches a mistyped directive before the room sees it
- `reveal-carve handout` turns this deck into a document with the spoken notes
- `reveal-carve watch` rebuilds and reloads while you write

